    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3535060/extras/036a83bbac92adf5c128b459b68cbfd5.poster.avif?t=1750995734\" width=738 height=414 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3535060/extras/036a83bbac92adf5c128b459b68cbfd5.webm?t=1750995734\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3535060/extras/036a83bbac92adf5c128b459b68cbfd5.mp4?t=1750995734\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>You wake up in a classroom way after your\u00a0lecture concludes. The person who wakes you up looks familiar. Oh right, it's that one popular guy that everyone likes. Vahn. Wait, Vahn??! Why???</i></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>He was in one of your classes this semester, but you've never spoken to him before. Besides you two, the room is empty.\u00a0Everyone else had already left ages ago. And no one else bothered waking you up? Rude.</i></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>With the light of the\u00a0setting sun on your skin, you engage in\u00a0conversation with the popular young man, realizing that things are taking a very scandalous turn, and that his interests are far more fascinating than you'd originally think.</i></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Lecture Me Later is an <strong>otome</strong>/visual novel with a <strong>single love interest</strong> set in a University\u00a0 setting. Chat with Vahn and see what kind of <span class=\"bb_strike\">freaky</span> <i>interesting</i> things he's into.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3535060/extras/d28cc46dfe1e30f4622154af22e3f2d4.avif?t=1750995734\" width=800 height=282 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Name</strong> the (female) MC. Depending on your choices, Vahn may 'say' her name.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3535060/extras/68cf7b81b047735629d5359c198d30bb.poster.avif?t=1750995734\" width=738 height=414 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3535060/extras/68cf7b81b047735629d5359c198d30bb.webm?t=1750995734\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3535060/extras/68cf7b81b047735629d5359c198d30bb.mp4?t=1750995734\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A unique <strong>2.5D</strong> visual novel experience. A relaxing (as relaxing as classrooms can be...) 3D environment with a nice 2D character to chat with.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3535060/extras/e8beab2764e9db2e2ceaf6cd8ff614e2.poster.avif?t=1750995734\" width=738 height=414 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3535060/extras/e8beab2764e9db2e2ceaf6cd8ff614e2.webm?t=1750995734\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3535060/extras/e8beab2764e9db2e2ceaf6cd8ff614e2.mp4?t=1750995734\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >An animated and expressive love interest thanks to <strong>Live2D</strong> Cubism. Vahn has some very... interesting expressions, with more to come in the full release.\u00a0</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Favorable answer</strong> indicator. See what answers and topics Vahn prefers.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A <strong>variety of choices</strong> for the player, giving fun <strong>replay-ability</strong> options.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>",
